],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It was warm last Sunday, so I went and sat on the river bank as usual.","start":31.9,"end":37.34,"score":0.994,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-030-005","sourceId":"b2-030-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Some children were playing games on the bank and there were some people rowing on the river.","start":38.77,"end":44.84,"score":0.984,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-030-006","sourceId":"b2-030-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Suddenly, one of the children kicked a ball very hard and it went towards a passing boat.","start":46.403,"end":53.86,"score":0.94,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-030-007","sourceId":"b2-030-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Some people on the bank called out to the man in the boat, but he did not hear them.","start":55.51,"end":61.64,"score":0.989,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-030-008","sourceId":"b2-030-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The ball struck him so hard that he nearly fell into the water.","start":62.86,"end":67.99,"score":0.97,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-030-009","sourceId":"b2-030-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I turned to look at the children, but there weren't any in sight: they had all run away!","start":68.99,"end":75.24,"score":0.958,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-030-010","sourceId":"b2-030-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The man laughed when he realized what had happened.","start":76.92,"end":79.92,"score":0.938,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-030-011","sourceId":"b2-030-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He called out to the children and threw the ball back to the bank.","start":80.88,"end":85.23,"score":0.936,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
